<p>Robert Mueller, the former FBI director and special counsel who led the Trump-Russia investigation, has died at 81, according to a family statement reported across multiple outlets. News of his death quickly renewed attention to his long public career, especially his leadership of the FBI after 9/11 and his 2017-2019 investigation into Russian interference in the 2016 US election and contacts between Russians and President Trump&#x27;s campaign. Coverage also revisited the investigation&#x27;s findings and political legacy. Multiple sources said Mueller documented Russian interference and numerous contacts between Russians and Trump&#x27;s campaign, but did not establish a criminal conspiracy between the campaign and Russia. His report also examined possible obstruction of justice; Politico noted that Mueller described potentially obstructive conduct but did not directly conclude that the president had broken the law. Several outlets also highlighted President Trump&#x27;s public response to Mueller&#x27;s death, including a Truth Social post saying he was glad Mueller had died.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/uk5QmLmXbUqBiNAvROJROV7tRB76k_BG-1zzLiEspuWyfhHegHIp4PUZ8o4ZjMY4V9eGXv9uxVVuL8d36jxWHhzQ0Omowa82jYZ4GcxP1_J-eYvZ45_099U5bcrEpq-yPpnEo8pbiZW9HNNlkJzYeJTExjLNAB2LNxEsIQpRLu3rdCjGib30eBJLGCy_S0KwKRyNpGAjmaipMJALFuD89xlojWbHmlElOXgLW0ko83EPAVsXdFYLQoIpHk8PGWkYuSuhg9syynra8Tq5nA' alt='FILE - Special counsel Robert S. Mueller III testifies on Capitol Hill in Washington before the House Judiciary Committee in Washington, July 24, 2019. Mueller, a former FBI director, died on Friday, March 20, 2026. He was 81. (AP Photo/Susan Walsh, File)' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Health disclosure: Mueller&#x27;s family said in August 2025 that he had been diagnosed with Parkinson&#x27;s disease in the summer of 2021 and had retired from teaching and legal practice as his health worsened.</li><li>Military background: Reports described Mueller as a decorated Vietnam War veteran who served in the Marines before his later career at the Justice Department and FBI.</li><li>National fixation: Politico said Mueller&#x27;s special-counsel investigation held America&#x27;s attention for two years as the country waited to see whether Trump or his aides would be found to have conspired with a foreign power.</li></ul><blockquote>Russia’s actions were a threat to America’s democracy. It was critical that they be investigated and understood. - Robert Mueller</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Mueller family: The family announced his death in a short statement and asked that their privacy be respected. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3347449/robert-mueller-special-counsel-who-investigated-russia-trump-campaign-ties-dies-81'>SCMP</a>)</li><li>President Trump: On Truth Social, President Trump said he was glad Mueller was dead and wrote that Mueller could no longer &#x27;hurt innocent people,&#x27; continuing his longstanding attack on the Russia investigation as a politically motivated &#x27;witch hunt.&#x27; (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/635756-trump-russiagate-mueller-death/'>RT</a>)</li><li>Critics of Trump: Critics and political opponents condemned the president&#x27;s response to Mueller&#x27;s death, and that outrage quickly became a major part of the immediate reaction. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/mar/21/trump-robert-mueller-death'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Obituary view: SCMP&#x27;s obituary emphasized Mueller&#x27;s role in reshaping the FBI into a terrorism-fighting force after the September 11 attacks, treating that as the other defining chapter of his public life beyond the Russia inquiry. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3347449/robert-mueller-special-counsel-who-investigated-russia-trump-campaign-ties-dies-81'>SCMP</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/what-was-the-mueller-investigation-and-what-did-it-find'>Robert Mueller dies: What was the Trump-Russia investigation he led? And what did it find?</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3347449/robert-mueller-special-counsel-who-investigated-russia-trump-campaign-ties-dies-81'>Robert Mueller, who probed Trump-Russia ties, dies. US president: ‘I’m glad he’s dead’</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/ex-fbi-chief-and-trump-investigator-robert-mueller-dies-at-81/a-76470745'>Ex-FBI chief and Trump investigator Robert Mueller dies at 81</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/mar/21/trump-robert-mueller-death'>‘Vile’ Trump condemned for gloating over Robert Mueller death</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c8dlj6gv0q6o'>Robert Mueller, ex-FBI chief who led Trump-Russia investigation, dies at 81</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/glad-hes-dead-trump-on-death-of-ex-fbi-chief-robert-mueller-who-probed-his-alleged-ties-with-russia-11248627#publisher=newsstand'>&quot;Glad He&#x27;s Dead&quot;: Trump On Death Of Ex-FBI Head Who Probed Russia Ties</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/obituaries/article/2026/03/21/former-fbi-director-robert-mueller-who-investigated-russia-trump-campaign-ties-dies_6751675_15.html'>Former FBI director Robert Mueller, who investigated Russia-Trump campaign ties, dies</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-robert-mueller-obituary-russia-trump-special-counsel-fbi/'>Robert Mueller, former FBI director who served as special counsel in Russia-Trump inquiry, dies</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ft.com/content/368059cb-ad49-495e-aefb-01288bd45a15'>Robert Mueller, former FBI director who led Trump inquiry, dies at 81</a> - ft.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/21/former-fbi-chief-robert-mueller-dead-at-81'>Former FBI chief Robert Mueller, known for Trump investigation, dead at 81</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/635756-trump-russiagate-mueller-death/'>Trump cheers death of Russiagate special counsel</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.politico.com/news/2026/03/21/robert-mueller-trump-special-counsel-fbi-obituary-00039059'>Robert Mueller, former FBI director who led Trump investigation, dies at 81</a> - politico.com</li></ul>